    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b882ff74_b65dd654",
        "filename": "crypto/fips140-integrity.c",
        "patchSetId": 22
      },
      "lineNbr": 482,
      "author": {
        "id": 1137063
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-06-01T19:55:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Isn\u0027t this racy?  If someone requests an algorithm after this, but before the fips implementations are registered, then it won\u0027t be found.\n\nIs there actually a need to unregister the builtin algorithms at all?  You already aren\u0027t unregistering the builtin templates, but instead are relying on the fips templates being prepended to the list (so that they will take priority).  Couldn\u0027t the same be done for the fips algorithms too?\n\nSo, something like:\n\n1. Append \"-builtin\" to cra_driver_name of any algorithm that has a fips copy (to avoid naming collisions in the next step)\n2. Register the fips algorithms and templates\n3. Remove template instances that use algorithms that have a fips copy\n4. Update the live algorithms",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 482,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 482,
        "endChar": 37
      },
      "revId": "4eb5230a3b6f267f8dcd5ef3a92478a3abbe4b85",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1173afde_6501d28a",
        "filename": "crypto/fips140-integrity.c",
        "patchSetId": 22
      },
      "lineNbr": 482,
      "author": {
        "id": 1843125
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-06-03T16:17:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d prefer to unregister anything that gets superseded, but the set of templates is not exposed in the same way, and I have been trying to make as few changes to the kernel proper as possible to accommodate this.\n\nI wonder if keeping the -builtin drivers registered in a way that leaves them accessible via the ordinary API violates the lab\u0027s requirements - I suppose we could check.",
      "parentUuid": "b882ff74_b65dd654",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 482,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 482,
        "endChar": 37
      },
      "revId": "4eb5230a3b6f267f8dcd5ef3a92478a3abbe4b85",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6e28ab60_5ab95bc5",
        "filename": "crypto/fips140-integrity.c",
