      "message": "Sure.  It\u0027s the same unintuitive ordering that the self-tests use, I suppose.  It would be helpful to add a comment that mentions that for FIPS certification purposes we have up until module_init finishes to finish the self-tests and integrity check (if that is indeed the case).",
